  keywords  = {materials > semiconductor > perovskite, materials > semiconductor > perovskite > MAPbI3, materials > semiconductor > perovskite > MAPbBr3, measurements > conductivity, measurements > photoconductivity, measurements > Hall effect, project > EFM, personnel > Tirmzi, collaborator > Hanrath},
