  keywords  = {materials > PES > P3HT, materials > PES > 5FPE-NTCDI, nanopatterning, nanopatterning > fluorinated photoresists, devices > diode, devices > solar cell > PES > bulk heterojunction, charge injection > measurements > EFM, charge injection > measurements > transport, SPM > EFM > PES},
