  abstract  = {Highlights: Single-chip ESR detector operating from 370\~K down to 4\~K; spin sensitivity down to \$10^\{6\} \\: \\mathrm\{spins\}/\\sqrt\{\\mathrm\{Hz\}\}\$ with DPPH at 4\~K; and Frequency noise down to \$1 \\: \\mathrm\{Hz\}/\\sqrt\{\\mathrm\{Hz\}\}\$ at 4\~K.

