  keywords  = {materials > complex oxides, materials > complex oxides > matl's > SrTiO3, materials > complex oxides > characterization > resistivity, materials > complex oxides > characterization > Hall effect, materials > complex oxides > properties > optical absorbtion, materials > complex oxides > properties > mobility},
