  abstract  = {We offer a wide range of optical, conductive and decorative coatings ...},
  comment   = {2010/05/13:

Dear John,

I had the pleasure of attending CCMR's Facilities 101 event on Friday, April 24th. I was quite impressed with the vast array of technical instruments, analytical equipment, cutting-edge services and capabilities that are available to EMF Corp. through Cornell - just a few short miles uphill from our facility. As a valued customer of EMF Corporation - and fellow Ithaca neighbor - I think it's a great idea that we communicate together and explore areas of mutual benefit between our organizations.

Brief history: EMF (Evaporated Metal Films) was founded by a team of engineers and physicists from Cornell University back in 1936. Almost 75 years later, EMF is still innovating and leading our industry with the finest evaporated metal film products and custom coatings in the world - and still manufactured right here in Ithaca, NY.

EMF has adopted a new proactive team approach to further enhance our customer-focused sales and service. My name is Scott Gallmeyer. I've recently joined the company and will be handling EMF's Gold, Copper and Aluminum Test Slide products, Mass Measurement Crystals and custom-coated Large Optics (up to 100" in diameter). I am working collaboratively with my Sales colleague, Joe Howe. I am handling the majority of the external communications with our customers, and working together with Joe as he handles the internal sales management in terms of RFQs, quotes, orders, and so on.

The following is a quick summary of our contact information, so we can be of best service to you for new Purchase Orders, Requests for Quote and general inquiries:

- Via Email: Please send POs, RFQs, drawings / specs and general inquiries to both Scott Gallmeyer at scott@emf-corp.com and Joe Howe at joe@emf-corp.com

- Via Fax: Please send POs, RFQs, drawings / specs and general inquiries to us at 607-272-3369, or Toll Free: 800-456-3227

- By Phone: Please contact us at 607-272-3320, or Toll Free: 800-456-7070; Scott -- Ext. 25 / Joe -- Ext. 32

- Online: Please visit our websites at www.emf-corp.com and www.riofoto.com to order EMF products online (fully redesigned websites with enhanced e-commerce in progress)

EMF would like to further develop and expand our relationship with Cornell University. Both Jon Shu and John Hunt have visited our plant within the past few weeks, and we had an opportunity to discuss some areas of mutual benefit between Cornell and EMF. We would like to extend an open invitation to have you to visit EMF in the near future, as well. Please feel free to contact us anytime to schedule a convenient hour or so and make the short drive down the hill to visit our facility off Cherry St. near Wegmans. We thank you for your time, we appreciate Cornell's continuing business with EMF and we look forward to hearing from you soon.

All the Best,

Scott Gallmeyer
