  keywords  = {project > EFM, personnel > Dwyer, personnel > Tirmzi, SPM > FM-KPFM, devices > OFET, charge trapping > measurements > transistor > SPM, charge trapping > measurements > SPM, charge injection > measurements > transistor > SPM, charge injection > measurements > SPM},
